No code from jevkit/skillpick.py was copied — this skill's script
(plugin/scripts/jev/skill-select.mjs) is a from-scratch Node implementation
and a single-request simplification of skillpick.py's batched, two-round-trip
design (that design targets catalogs of hundreds of skills across a whole
Hermes fleet; a Claude Code session's catalog is far smaller).
